{
  "$comment": "The one set of pipeline endpoint fixtures (#48). Both toolchains read this file: agent/internal/httpapi/pipelines_fixtures_test.go and packages/schema/src/pipelines-fixtures.test.ts. Never copy it per language. lists are PipelineList answers (GET /api/pipelines), documents are PipelineDocument answers (GET /api/pipelines/open and POST /api/pipelines), requests are CreatePipelineRequest bodies (POST), errors are PipelinesError answers; each side checks them against the authoritative JSON Schema and against what it was generated into. The packages/web component tests render every valid list and error here.",
